<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The Behavior board line rig.yml's wiring gives the ZapitTrigger (Board): publishes it as the AsyncSubject ZapitTriggerLine, which Zapit's trials hold high from the trigger until they clear it, or None on a rig without one, where setting it stops the workflow (SetZapitTriggerLine). The line is in pulse mode (PulseOutputs writes its FixedPulse width from rig.yml), so if the workflow dies with it high the board ends it after that width. Stops the workflow at start if more than one line on Board has the ZapitTrigger or its line is not DO1, DO2 or DO3.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Board" Description="The Behavior board the Zapit trigger is wired to, such as BehaviorBoard-Main." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigFile</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigFile</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
        <PropertyMappings>
          <Property Name="RigFile" />
        </PropertyMappings>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="dev:WiredOutput">
          <dev:RigFile>UNMAPPED</dev:RigFile>
          <dev:Board />
          <dev:Device>ZapitTrigger</dev:Device>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
        <Name>ZapitTriggerLine</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="4" Label="Source3" />
      <Edge From="1" To="4" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
